{
    "title": "Swiggy: Food Instamart Dineout",
    "description": "Hungry or Need Groceries? \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f\ud83c\udf54\r\n\r\nWelcome to Swiggy, your one-stop shop for online food ordering, groceries, dining, and convenient pickup & delivery!\r\nHere\u2019s why India LOVES Swiggy \ud83d\udc47\r\n- Order food, get instant grocery delivery, & other essential services online\r\n- Swiggy One users get unlimited Free Delivery on all orders\r\n- Find top local restaurants in your city\r\n- Order Groceries & enjoy lightening fast delivery in 10 Mins\r\n- Get great discounts by paying dining out bills via Swiggy Dineout\r\n- Pick up & Drop anything instantly, anywhere within your city\r\n- Restaurant & Delivery Partners trained in hygiene protocols\r\n- 30+ cuisines to choose from\r\n- Late-night delivery services\r\n- Real-time updates on your order status & an ETA\r\n- Enjoy long-distance deliveries from your favourite restaurants\r\n- We accept payments via VISA/MasterCard Credit or Debit Cards, Net Banking, Paytm, FreeCharge, MobiKwik wallet, Sodexo Meal Cards, cash on delivery & credit services like LazyPay.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd59Food Delivery: Order Delicious Food With A Tap\ud83e\udd59\r\n\r\nUnlock Up To 60% Off + Free Delivery with Pocket Hero\u2019s picks\r\nThat\u2019s not all! There\u2019s No Minimum Order conditions so you can order even a single item on Swiggy\r\n- Order Chicken Biryani, Margherita Pizza, Masala Dosa, Veg & Chicken Burgers, Lassi, Veg & non-veg noodles, Coffee, Tacos, Chicken Momos, Desserts & more.\r\n- Explore our endless range of cuisines like North Indian, Chinese, South Indian, Thai, Vietnamese, American, Healthy, Street Food, Breakfast, Late Night Cravings, & more.\r\n- Get North Indian dishes, Punjabi cuisine, South Indian cuisine, Thai cuisine, Bengali cuisine & with top chains like Dominos pizza, Wow momo, KFC, Burger King, Pizza Hut, FreshMenu, McDonald\u2019s, Subway, Faasos, Starbucks coffee & more.\r\n- Find local restaurants, breakfast places, brunch spots, cafes & bars\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uded2 INSTAMART- Get Anything In 10 Minutes \ud83d\uded2\r\n\r\nSwiggy Instamart is an instant delivery service powered by Swiggy, delivering groceries & more to your doorstep within 10 Minutes. Just place an order & we\u2019ll take care of your groceries, emergency supplies, midnight cravings, cake deliveries & more.\r\n\r\nFrom lays chips, davidoff coffee, & diet coke to fruits, vegetables, Amul ice cream delivery, dairy, galaxy chocolate, cooking to cleaning essentials, personal care products like Santoor soap, sunsilk shampoo, to baby care - you can fulfill all your grocery needs on Swiggy Instamart.\r\n\r\n- Now Present in over 30+ cities, open from 6am - late night* for Grocery Essentials like Maggi, Pringles Chips, Nescafe Coffee & more.\r\n- Grab 10,000+ products across groceries & other categories like toys, stationery, home & kitchen appliances, electronics, beauty & more.\r\n*Opening & closing time might vary across cities, owing to Govt. regulations.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0fDINEOUT - deals on dining out at top restaurants\r\nUse Swiggy Dineout to get up to 50% FLAT discounts with no upper limit on your dining out bills.\r\n\r\n- Over 35000 restaurants across 40 cities\r\n- Additional up to 15% off on your bills with HDFC Bank Credit Cards\r\n- Pre-booking / reserve your table options for hassle-free dining\r\n- Top restaurants near you, ranging from top trending cafes, bars, pubs, breweries, luxury dining, kid-friendly, rooftop dining, brunch buffets, and much more!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude84SWIGGY GENIE- Get Anything Delivered\ud83e\ude84\r\nAvailable in 70+ cities, with Swiggy Genie you can pick up or deliver anything across your city effortlessly.\r\n- Send documents, packages & home cooked food items\r\n- Pick up things you've forgotten\r\n- OTC medicine delivery from pharmacies\r\nEnjoy Unlimited discounts, cashback, & offers with Swiggy One.\r\n\r\nWondering how to get unlimited benefits across restaurants, Instamart & Genie orders on Swiggy? With Swiggy One, you'll experience savings like never before. Here are the top features you don't want to miss:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf54Unlimited free delivery from top restaurants\r\n\ud83c\udf55Extra 30% discount from popular restaurants\r\n\ud83d\uded2Free delivery on Instamart on orders> \u20b999\r\n\ud83d\ude97No additional surge fee\r\n\ud83d\ude8010% discount on Swiggy Genie",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hungry or Need Groceries? \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f\ud83c\udf54<br><br>Welcome to Swiggy, your one-stop shop for online food ordering, groceries, dining, and convenient pickup &amp; delivery!<br>Here\u2019s why India LOVES Swiggy \ud83d\udc47<br>- Order food, get instant grocery delivery, &amp; other essential services online<br>- Swiggy One users get unlimited Free Delivery on all orders<br>- Find top local restaurants in your city<br>- Order Groceries &amp; enjoy lightening fast delivery in 10 Mins<br>- Get great discounts by paying dining out bills via Swiggy Dineout<br>- Pick up &amp; Drop anything instantly, anywhere within your city<br>- Restaurant &amp; Delivery Partners trained in hygiene protocols<br>- 30+ cuisines to choose from<br>- Late-night delivery services<br>- Real-time updates on your order status &amp; an ETA<br>- Enjoy long-distance deliveries from your favourite restaurants<br>- We accept payments via VISA/MasterCard Credit or Debit Cards, Net Banking, Paytm, FreeCharge, MobiKwik wallet, Sodexo Meal Cards, cash on delivery &amp; credit services like LazyPay.<br><br>\ud83e\udd59Food Delivery: Order Delicious Food With A Tap\ud83e\udd59<br><br>Unlock Up To 60% Off + Free Delivery with Pocket Hero\u2019s picks<br>That\u2019s not all! There\u2019s No Minimum Order conditions so you can order even a single item on Swiggy<br>- Order Chicken Biryani, Margherita Pizza, Masala Dosa, Veg &amp; Chicken Burgers, Lassi, Veg &amp; non-veg noodles, Coffee, Tacos, Chicken Momos, Desserts &amp; more.<br>- Explore our endless range of cuisines like North Indian, Chinese, South Indian, Thai, Vietnamese, American, Healthy, Street Food, Breakfast, Late Night Cravings, &amp; more.<br>- Get North Indian dishes, Punjabi cuisine, South Indian cuisine, Thai cuisine, Bengali cuisine &amp; with top chains like Dominos pizza, Wow momo, KFC, Burger King, Pizza Hut, FreshMenu, McDonald\u2019s, Subway, Faasos, Starbucks coffee &amp; more.<br>- Find local resta